# SkillForge Docker build-context boundary
# Keeps the build context lean: backend source + skills/ + knowledge/ + web/ only.
# Plan 07-01 / D7-04 (source-build images). Anything sensitive or non-runtime goes here.

# --- Planning / workflow / VCS artifacts (never in the image) ---
.planning/
.git/
.gitignore
.claude/

# --- Local runtime data / secrets ---
.env
.env.local
skillforge.db
skillforge.db-shm
skillforge.db-wal

# --- Build artifacts (host-built; the image builds its own) ---
*.exe
eval.exe
spike-*trace.json
web/dist/
web/node_modules/
node_modules/
dist/

# --- Go test residue (2026-11-09 / C6) ---
# 测试临时根曾建在包目录内且删除静默失败，最坏时在构建上下文里堆了
# 1.68 GB 的 duckdb 暂存数据。根因已修，这里排除以防万一。
skillforge-server-test-*
skillforge-data-test-*
raw-never-*
server
server.test

# --- Host runtime state (never in the image) ---
data/
.skillforge-cache/

# --- README assets (not a runtime dependency) ---
docs/demo*.gif

# --- Docker / compose definitions (avoid recursive context surprises) ---
Dockerfile
Dockerfile.*
docker-compose.yml
docker-compose.*.yml

# --- OS noise ---
.DS_Store
